+  "recuerdo": "Use case: ads-marketing. Create finished premium Spanish portrait advertisement, 1080x1350 aspect ratio 4:5. Brand Hunab Ku, Mexican quinceañera photography. Input image is the REAL logo, use that exact logo discreetly small at upper right inset at least 80px (roughly 170px wide), never make it giant, do not invent a different logo.\nGolden rule: image must feel like a beautiful cinematic film scene at sunset with real textured skin and breathing space. A realistic Mexican fifteen-year-old girl, age-appropriate, dark brown long gently wavy hair, natural makeup, wearing an elegant long forest green #2F3E2E quinceañera dress with real fabric folds. Three-quarter length or full body, standing calmly, BOTH HANDS BEHIND HER BACK entirely hidden. Girl placed on right/lower part, face unobscured by copy. Soft warm sunset SIDE LIGHT illuminates face clearly, NOT hard backlight. Blurred open Sonoran countryside with muted grasses and distant hills. One consistent shadow direction, natural pores, fine film grain, no plastic smoothing. Large cinematic photograph occupying 75 percent of canvas height. Plenty of upper negative space grading seamlessly into solid Crepúsculo #0B132B.\nGraphic palette exactly Crepúsculo #0B132B background, Dorado Cálido #D4A373 accents and CTA, Arena #E8DFCA lettering, Verde Bosque #2F3E2E support/dress. No pink, fuchsia, neon yellow, pure black graphic elements, emerald, terracotta, flowers, balloons, hearts, glitter. Natural skin color allowed.\nElegant editorial film-poster typography: headline Playfair Display Bold 78px equivalent, support Montserrat SemiBold 38px, footer Source Sans 3 29px, CTA Montserrat bold 36px. ALL copy and logo within 80px safe margin on all sides. Do not place any text over face. Headline upper left across three lines: \"Que la recuerden\" / \"como en una\" / \"película\". Exact supporting text nearby clearly legible across two lines: \"Fotografía y video de XV con\" / \"tratamiento cinematográfico\". Lower footer exact: \"Hunab Ku · Nogales, Sonora y sur de Arizona\". Bottom gold solid CTA rectangle (not touching edge) with deep twilight text EXACT: \"Aparta tu fecha por WhatsApp\". Footer above CTA. Elegant understated restrained design, photographic storytelling first. All accents must be perfect. No additional copy."
+}

